Warning [jet.InferredNeverReturn]: Public function `fail` always diverges but does not declare `Never`
  --> tests/ui_lint/inferred_never_return.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | fail: fn(message: String) {
    | ^^^^
 Why: Inferred divergence is useful to callers but is not part of the written API contract
 Fix: Write `-> Never` as the return type, for example `fail: fn() -> Never`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L2421

Warning [jet.InferredNeverReturn]: Public function `stop` always diverges but does not declare `Never`
  --> tests/ui_lint/inferred_never_return.jet:8:1
    |
  8 | stop: fn(code: Int) -> Int {
    | ^^^^
 Why: Inferred divergence is useful to callers but is not part of the written API contract
 Fix: Write `-> Never` as the return type, for example `stop: fn() -> Never`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L2421

Warning [jet.PositionalBoolParameter]: Public function `maybe` has a positional `Bool` parameter `flag`
  --> tests/ui_lint/inferred_never_return.jet:17:11
    |
 17 | maybe: fn(flag: Bool) {
    |           ^^^^
 Why: Positional booleans are easy to transpose at the call site
 Fix: Callers can write `flag: true` to make the intent clear (S61 labels)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L2401
